! Cooling parameters.
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------
1d2     	Initial temperature in units of 10^8 K. (1d1-1d2)
0 7		SF n in the crust: isfcru (0,1), imodcru (1-7)
0 12		SF n in the core: isfn (0,1), imodn (11-16)
0 8		SF p in the core: isfp (0,1), imodp (8-10)
1 0		itevol (0,1), iquant (0=no, 1=outer crust, 2=everywhere)
0		Envelope (ienv). (0=Fe, 1=accreted, 2=Gudmundsson)
0.1d0 0.1d0	Qimp, Qpasta
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------
! Magnetic field evolution parameters.
!-----------------------------------------------------------------------
0.d0  1.d3	Poloidal and toroidal field amplitudes (b12, b12tor).
1		Initial magnetic field geometry (bgeom). (See BINIT.)
1		Magnetic field in the core (bcint). (0=yes, 1=superconductor)
0		Surface boundary condition (bcout). (See note A below.)
1		Magnetic field evolution (ibevol). (1=yes)
1 1 0		Hall, Ohm, and ambipolar terms (ihall, ires, icore).
